# Literature Expansion Report: Direction 02 (Coding & Selection)

**Scope & Direction:** Short ORF artefacts, metagenomic gene prediction, frameshift nulls, NG86 dN/dS limitations, codon alignment and ascertainment, recurrence-matched controls.  
**Target Manuscript:** P4 Rub' al-Khali Soil Metagenome (*"Known phyla, unknown proteome: a controlled census of the Rub' al-Khali soil metagenome"*).  
**Assigned Papers Directory:** [`resources/literature/darkmatter-2026-10-13/papers/02_coding_selection`](file:///home/leechuck/Documents/papers/empty-quarter-mags/resources/literature/darkmatter-2026-10-13/papers/02_coding_selection)  
**Manifest:** [`MANIFEST.tsv`](file:///home/leechuck/Documents/papers/empty-quarter-mags/resources/literature/darkmatter-2026-10-13/papers/02_coding_selection/MANIFEST.tsv)  
**Search Synthesis:** [`02_coding_selection.md`](file:///home/leechuck/Documents/papers/empty-quarter-mags/resources/literature/darkmatter-2026-10-13/search/02_coding_selection.md)

